EN:
That was close!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I guess we were
just luckier than you today,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}.

IT:
Ce l'avevi quasi fatta!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Mi sa che oggi, però, la fortuna
era dalla{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} nostra, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.

TRANSLATION:
